Description: Terminal music player for YouTube Music
 A feature-rich terminal UI for streaming and managing your YouTube Music
 library. Browse playlists, search songs, download tracks, and play music
 directly in your terminal with real album art support.
 .
 Features:
  * Browse your YouTube Music playlists and library
  * Full-text search across YouTube Music
  * Download tracks with cover art
  * Play local music folders
  * Real album art in terminal (Kitty graphics protocol)
  * Queue management, shuffle, repeat modes
  * Multiple themes (Tokyo Night, Gruvbox, Catppuccin, etc.)
  * Gapless streaming with mpv backend
